# Protect samples/ originals

Under **no circumstances** delete, move-replace, overwrite, truncate, or clean up original files in `samples/` (case-insensitive: `Samples`, `SAMPLES`, etc.).

Protected originals include at minimum:
- `samples/45431_Pilgrims RTE Main Plant R25.rvt`
- `samples/45430_AFIP1035.pdf`
- `samples/45430_AFIP1035.dwg`

## Allowed

- **Read** / inspect originals
- **Copy** originals into other folders (e.g. `deliverables/`, working dirs) if needed

## Forbidden

- `Remove-Item`, `rm`, `del`, or any delete on `samples/**`
- Renaming or restructuring that risks Windows case-collision (`Samples` vs `samples`)
- Deleting a parent folder that contains `samples/`
- "Cleanup" that touches `samples/` without explicit user approval naming each file

If reorganization is needed, **copy** out — never delete the source in `samples/`.
